[0.001, "o", "\u001b[38;5;16m\u001b[48;5;255mFor storage I suspect we can get very far with sqlite. I would like to try and avoid saving the receipt images at all, and just \u001b[39m  \u001b[10;1H  \u001b[38;5;16mstoring extracted and user-corrected data.\u001b[39m                                                                                        \u001b[11;1H                                                                                                                                    \u001b[12;1H  \u001b[38;5;16mFor the front-end I've done some React programming before, so I'd like to work with that.\u001b[39m                                         \u001b[13;1H                                                                                                                                    \u001b[14;1H  \u001b[38;5;16mI think we shoudl discuss:\u001b[39m                                                                                                        \u001b[15;1H                                                                      \u001b(B\u001b[m"]
[0.0, "o", "\u001b[48;5;255m                                                              \u001b[16;1H  \u001b[38;5;16m- The schema for storage of receipts\u001b[39m                                                                                              \u001b[17;1H  \u001b[38;5;16m- The API endpoints for sending requests to the server and what they need to have\u001b[39m                                                 \u001b[18;1H  \u001b[38;5;16m- The pages and content of the pages, and interactions on the pages\u001b[39m                                                               \u001b[19;1H                                                                                                                                    \u001b[20;1H  \u001b[38;5;16mConsult the design document to see what else we've thought through for this, and let's update the design and think through what \u001b[39m  \u001b[21;1H  \u001b[38;5;16mto do first.\u001b[39m                                                                                                   \u001b(B\u001b[m"]
