[0.002, "o", "\u001b[29;1H\u001b[38;5;248m\u001b[48;5;255m\u276f \u001b[38;5;16mOK this is starting to make sense. Should we call this \"server.ts\" or something? Index is usually reserved for the front page of \u001b[39m \u001b[30;1H  \u001b[38;5;16ma frontend, right?\u001b[39m                                                                                                                \u001b[31;1H                                                                                                                                    \u001b[32;1H  \u001b[38;5;16mWhat will the implementation look like for filling in these request handlers?\u001b[39m                                                     \u001b[33;3H\u001b[49m    \u001b[C    \u001b[C   \u001b[C              \u001b[C    \u001b[C    \u001b[C   \u001b[C       \u001b[C  \u001b[C     \u001b[C       \u001b[C          \r\n\u001b[38;5;174m\u2736\u001b[39m \u001b[38;5;174mWhisking\u2026 \u001b[39m                                                                                                                        \u001b[35;1H\u001b[38;5;241m  \u23bf \u00a0Tip: Run claude --continue or claude --resume to resume a conversati\u001b(B\u001b[m"]
